Bezalel's study tools are an Elixir port of its query layer, tool handlers
and output formats; they live in bezalel_core
(https://github.com/GenericJam/bezalel_core), whose NOTICE says what they
take from it. In this repository, data/scripts/make_fixtures.py mirrors its
lexicon search and data/build.sh runs its database build at that commit.
